{"id": "n01", "old_id": null, "set": "en", "lang": "en", "topic": "work", "type": "multi", "question": "I'm American. Once I finish my master's degree in Germany, can I get a work visa?", "expected_behavior": "answer", "gold_sections": ["AufenthG § 20 Abs. 1", "AufenthG § 18b", "AufenthV § 41 Abs. 1"], "persona_country": "US", "persona_group": "non_eu", "notes": "졸업 후 구직 체류허가(§ 20), 전문인력(§ 18b). 미국인은 독일 안에서 체류허가 신청 가능(AufenthV § 41)", "translated_from": "ko", "translated_by": "claude-opus-5-5", "translation_reviewed": false, "verified": false}
{"id": "n02", "old_id": null, "set": "en", "lang": "en", "topic": "work", "type": "multi", "question": "What do Nigerian citizens have to do to work in Germany?", "expected_behavior": "answer", "gold_sections": ["AufenthG § 18a", "AufenthG § 18b", "AufenthG § 19c Abs. 1"], "persona_country": "NG", "persona_group": "non_eu", "notes": "비EU 일반 경로. 특례 국가(BeschV § 26) 아님. 질문이 넓어 정답 조항을 대표 경로로 한정", "open_question": "질문 범위가 넓음", "translated_from": "ko", "translated_by": "claude-opus-5-5", "translation_reviewed": false, "verified": false}
{"id": "n03", "old_id": null, "set": "en", "lang": "en", "topic": "registration", "type": "single", "question": "I'm moving from Italy to Germany. Do I have to do the Anmeldung?", "expected_behavior": "answer", "gold_sections": ["BMG § 17 Abs. 1"], "persona_country": "IT", "persona_group": "eu", "notes": "전입신고 의무는 국적과 무관. 이사 후 2주 안", "translated_from": "ko", "translated_by": "claude-opus-5-5", "translation_reviewed": false, "verified": false}
{"id": "n04", "old_id": null, "set": "en", "lang": "en", "topic": "eu", "type": "multi", "question": "Can Polish citizens live in Germany without a visa and without doing the Anmeldung?", "expected_behavior": "answer", "gold_sections": ["FreizügG/EU § 2a Abs. 1", "FreizügG/EU § 2 Abs. 2", "BMG § 17 Abs. 1"], "persona_country": "PL", "persona_group": "eu", "notes": "비자·체류허가는 필요 없음(§ 2a), 자유이동 권리(§ 2). 그러나 전입신고는 해야 함(BMG § 17)", "translated_from": "ko", "translated_by": "claude-opus-5-5", "translation_reviewed": false, "verified": false}
{"id": "n05", "old_id": null, "set": "en", "lang": "en", "topic": "benefits", "type": "refusal", "question": "I'm Syrian and I'm here as a refugee. What money can I receive?", "expected_behavior": "refuse_out_of_scope", "gold_sections": [], "persona_country": "SY", "persona_group": "non_eu", "notes": "급여(AsylbLG, SGB II)는 코퍼스 밖 → 거절 타깃", "translated_from": "ko", "translated_by": "claude-opus-5-5", "translation_reviewed": false, "verified": false}
{"id": "n06", "old_id": null, "set": "en", "lang": "en", "topic": "visa", "type": "multi", "question": "I'm coming to Germany from India. Do I need a visa?", "expected_behavior": "answer", "gold_sections": ["AufenthG § 4 Abs. 1", "AufenthG § 6 Abs. 3", "AufenthV § 15"], "persona_country": "IN", "persona_group": "non_eu", "notes": "장기 체류는 국가 비자(§ 6 Abs. 3). 단기 체류 비자 면제 여부는 EU 규정 2018/1806(코퍼스 밖): 독일 법 부분은 답하고 그 규정을 참조하라고 안내해야 함", "translated_from": "ko", "translated_by": "claude-opus-5-5", "translation_reviewed": false, "verified": false}
{"id": "n07", "old_id": null, "set": "en", "lang": "en", "topic": "residence", "type": "multi", "question": "Can someone with dual citizenship get permanent residence in Germany? The countries are Brazil and Australia.", "expected_behavior": "answer", "gold_sections": ["AufenthG § 9 Abs. 2", "AufenthV § 41 Abs. 1", "AufenthV § 41 Abs. 2"], "persona_country": "BR+AU", "persona_group": "non_eu", "notes": "영주권 요건(§ 9)은 국적 무관. 호주는 § 41 Abs. 1(취업 포함 특례), 브라질은 § 41 Abs. 2(취업 제외)라 어느 여권을 쓰느냐가 중요", "translated_from": "ko", "translated_by": "claude-opus-5-5", "translation_reviewed": false, "verified": false}
{"id": "n08", "old_id": null, "set": "en", "lang": "en", "topic": "visa", "type": "multi", "question": "Citizens of which countries can enter Germany without a visa and stay for more than two months?", "expected_behavior": "answer", "gold_sections": ["AufenthV § 41 Abs. 1", "AufenthV § 41 Abs. 2", "AufenthV § 15"], "persona_country": "", "persona_group": "none", "notes": "§ 41 목록 국가. 일반 무비자 90일 규칙은 EU 규정 2018/1806·솅겐 규정(코퍼스 밖): 그 규정을 참조하라고 안내해야 함", "translated_from": "ko", "translated_by": "claude-opus-5-5", "translation_reviewed": false, "verified": false}
{"id": "n09", "old_id": null, "set": "en", "lang": "en", "topic": "work", "type": "single", "question": "Does Germany have a visa for freelancers?", "expected_behavior": "answer", "gold_sections": ["AufenthG § 21 Abs. 5"], "persona_country": "", "persona_group": "none", "notes": "프리랜서 체류허가", "translated_from": "ko", "translated_by": "claude-opus-5-5", "translation_reviewed": false, "verified": false}
{"id": "n10", "old_id": null, "set": "en", "lang": "en", "topic": "social", "type": "multi", "question": "Can people from non-EU countries also join the artists' social insurance?", "expected_behavior": "answer", "gold_sections": ["KSVG § 1", "SGB IV § 3"], "persona_country": "", "persona_group": "non_eu", "notes": "KSVG § 1은 국적 조건 없이 독일에서 활동하는 자영업 예술가·저널리스트를 보험 대상으로 함. 적용 범위는 독일 내 활동(SGB IV § 3)", "translated_from": "ko", "translated_by": "claude-opus-5-5", "translation_reviewed": false, "verified": false}
{"id": "n11", "old_id": null, "set": "en", "lang": "en", "topic": "work", "type": "single", "question": "After graduating I got the 18-month job-seeker residence permit. If I don't find a job within 18 months, do I have to leave Germany? Can it be extended?", "expected_behavior": "answer", "gold_sections": ["AufenthG § 20 Abs. 2"], "persona_country": "", "persona_group": "none", "notes": "§ 20 Abs. 2: 18개월을 넘는 연장은 배제됨(원문 확인)", "translated_from": "ko", "translated_by": "claude-opus-5-5", "translation_reviewed": false, "verified": false}
{"id": "n12", "old_id": null, "set": "en", "lang": "en", "topic": "visa", "type": "multi", "question": "I'm South Korean and stayed in Germany visa-free for two and a half months. If I go back home and then come back, can I stay again for less than three months?", "expected_behavior": "answer", "gold_sections": ["AufenthV § 15", "AufenthV § 41 Abs. 1", "AufenthV § 41 Abs. 3"], "persona_country": "KR", "persona_group": "non_eu", "notes": "솅겐 90/180일 규칙은 EU 규정(코퍼스 밖): 그 규정을 참조하라고 안내해야 함. 한국인은 § 41로 체류허가를 독일 안에서 신청 가능(입국 후 90일 안)", "open_question": "한독 양자 사증면제협정(AufenthV § 16, 부록 A)은 부록이 파싱되지 않음", "translated_from": "ko", "translated_by": "claude-opus-5-5", "translation_reviewed": false, "verified": false}
